FROM golang:1.27.3-alpine@sha256:b8c9b82affbbb82a020bbcf998dad2ba9516944ac7e883524642a481a9505e9c AS build
ARG GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org
ENV GOPROXY=${GOPROXY} GOTOOLCHAIN=local
WORKDIR /src
COPY scripts/storage-bootstrap/go.mod scripts/storage-bootstrap/go.sum ./
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod go mod download
COPY scripts/storage-bootstrap/main.go ./
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod --mount=type=cache,target=/root/.cache/go-build \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -mod=readonly -trimpath -ldflags='-s -w' -o /storage-bootstrap .
FROM scratch
COPY --from=build /storage-bootstrap /storage-bootstrap
USER 10001:10001
ENTRYPOINT ["/storage-bootstrap"]
